# TurboPanel dev — Stripe CLI forwarder (turbopanel-stripe-listen).
# Read by the stripe-listen wrapper and the billing test-clock harness. The
# instance unit does not load it (billing is Workers-only; a wrangler dev
# instance takes these from .dev.vars).
#
# TURBOPANEL_STRIPE_SECRET_KEY: paste a TEST-MODE key (sk_test_…) from your
# Stripe sandbox. Nothing generates this; keep it out of git. Leave it blank
# and the forwarder exits with a pointer to this file.
TURBOPANEL_STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# TURBOPANEL_STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET: rewritten by the wrapper on every
# start from `stripe listen --print-secret`. Do not edit by hand.
TURBOPANEL_STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET=
